@startuml
left to right direction
state "Waiting for input" as Wait #palegreen
state Running #pink;line:red;line.dashed
[*] --> Wait
Wait --> Running : start
Running --> Wait : stop
Running --> Running : tick
note right of Running : this is a note
note left of Wait
  A longer note
  with two lines
end note
Wait --> [*]
note on link : final
state History {
  [*] --> A
  A -> B
  [H] --> B
  [H*] --> A
}
@enduml
